## 2026-11-11 — Reading plan “Read Today” screen

**For users**
- Tapping **Read Today** on a plan now opens a **cleaner Bible view** with more room for the text.
- The usual **top menu and bottom tabs hide** while you’re reading that day’s passage.
- A **Back to plan** button at the top returns you to the plan page (device **Back** does the same on Android).
- You can **scroll to the very bottom** of the chapter without the last verses sitting under buttons.
- **Study hint** is optional: tap to show or hide short notes; they no longer take over the whole screen.
- **Next passage** or **Mark day complete** stays in a simple bar at the bottom when you’re done.

